# A schematic Tithe Farm for replays. Not the real map: eight of the farm's patches in two
# columns of four with a path between, the fruit sack at the south end of the path, a water
# barrel at the north end and the farm door south of the sack.
#
# Facts:
#  - names are RuneLite's (net.runelite.api.gameval): the empty patch HOSIDIUS_TITHE_EMPTY
#    ("Tithe patch"), the sack TITHE_SACK_OF_FRUIT_EMPTY ("Sack"), the farm door
#    HOSIDIUS_TITHE_FARM_DOOR ("Farm door") and the water barrel WATER_BARREL1 (5598 on the wiki,
#    whose Water barrel page counts four in the Tithe Farm)
#  - OSRS wiki, Tithe Farm: fruit "can then be deposited into any of several sacks around the farm"
#  - patches are three tiles square here, as the game's patch objects are drawn; the real farm's
#    layout is not copied
#
#   y 3513           barrel (1804)
#   y 3509  a4 (1800)              b4 (1806)
#   y 3506  a3                     b3
#   y 3503  a2                     b2
#   y 3500  a1                     b1
#   y 3496           sack (1804)
#   y 3490           door (1804)
#        x 1800                    1806

scene 1760 3460

object HOSIDIUS_TITHE_EMPTY 1800 3500 3 3 as a1
object HOSIDIUS_TITHE_EMPTY 1800 3503 3 3 as a2
object HOSIDIUS_TITHE_EMPTY 1800 3506 3 3 as a3
object HOSIDIUS_TITHE_EMPTY 1800 3509 3 3 as a4
object HOSIDIUS_TITHE_EMPTY 1806 3500 3 3 as b1
object HOSIDIUS_TITHE_EMPTY 1806 3503 3 3 as b2
object HOSIDIUS_TITHE_EMPTY 1806 3506 3 3 as b3
object HOSIDIUS_TITHE_EMPTY 1806 3509 3 3 as b4
object TITHE_SACK_OF_FRUIT_EMPTY 1804 3496 as sack
object WATER_BARREL1 1804 3513 as barrel
object HOSIDIUS_TITHE_FARM_DOOR 1804 3490 as door
